### <stack>-<region>-<customerSafename>-<environmentSafename>
### Builds https://app-<stack>-<region>.productmarketingcloud.com/env/<customer>/<environment>/app/enrich
### and https://portal2-<stack>-<region>.productmarketingcloud.com/app/enrich
TEST_CONFIGURATION_NAME="dev1a-euw-autotestuideveuw-autotestuiodl"

### Test user credentials (needs access to the environment on both hosts)
TEST_USERNAME=
TEST_PASSWORD=

### Optional portal2 override (default https://portal2-<stack>-<region>.productmarketingcloud.com/)
# TEST_PORTAL2_URL=

### PERF_RUNS: measured loads per page and site (1-100, default 10)
### PERF_PAGES: "all" or comma-separated ids, e.g. enrich,dashboard,planner (default all)
### PERF_TIMEOUT: per-navigation timeout in ms (default 60000)
### PERF_OUTPUT_DIR: folder for comparison.json / comparison.html (default perf-results)
# PERF_RUNS=10
# PERF_PAGES=all
# PERF_TIMEOUT=60000
# PERF_OUTPUT_DIR=perf-results
